[40.748669, "o", "\u001b[1;36m# How to use \u001b[0;32m/dev:dev-tdd\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;32m/dev:dev-tdd\u001b[0m runs the \u001b[1mRed-Green-Refactor\u001b[0m TDD cycle: tests are written BEFORE the code, then minimal code makes them pass, then refactoring improves quality without breaking tests.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;33m## Basic usage\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[2;37m```\u001b[0m\r\n/dev:dev-tdd \"description of the feature or bugfix\"\r\n\u001b[2;37m```\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[57.753464, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J"]
[57.753771, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1;36m❯\u001b[0m Next : \u001b[1;32mcd ./my-app && claude\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  Then drive the 6-phase workflow with one command :\r\n  \u001b[1;33m/work:work-flow-feature \"add a /counter route\"\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[4;36mhttps://github.com/christopherlouet/claude-base\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
